SUMMARY:HUMOR.US - Anthony Poponi
DESCRIPTION:Comedy meets positive psychology in a joy-fueled night of laughs\, life lessons\, and lovable mishaps.\nYou might know him as Anthony… or Tony\, Toni\, Tony Poponi\, even Togna Popogna (if you know\, you know). By day\, he’s a sought-after happiness expert speaking at conferences and workplaces around the world\, guiding audiences toward more fulfilling lives using research from positive psychology. By night\, he’s a high-energy comedian\, emcee\, and improv performer bringing big laughs through Humor.us Productions. \nHe may be one of the happiest comedians you’ll ever meet—but that doesn’t mean life goes perfectly. From awkward misunderstandings to unforgettable mishaps\, Anthony shares the hilarious (and very human) stories that prove joy isn’t about perfection—it’s about perspective. Come ready to laugh\, learn\, and leave a little lighter.\nConnect with him on LinkedIn\, Instagram on Only Fans. \nFeaturing opening act: Liam Gibler. Liam Gibler is a stand-up comedian and improviser. He was a semi-finalist in 2025’s Portland’s Funniest Person Competition\, 2x winner of the ‘so you think you got jokes’ comedy competition and won Central Oregon’s 1st Improv Grand Prix with a randomly selected team of improvisers. \nTickets $20 in advance\, $25 at the door. Doors open 7:00pm.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/humor-us-anthony-poponi/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Poponi.jpg
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The California Theatre of Santa Rosa 528 7th Street Santa Rosa CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=528 7th Street:geo:-122.71621,38.44252
END:VEVENT
