SUMMARY:Sonoma Valley Authors Festival
DESCRIPTION:The 9th Annual Sonoma Valley Authors Festival returns May 1–3\, 2026\, at the Fairmont Sonoma Mission Inn & Spa for an intimate\, thoughtfully curated literary experience. Designed to “stimulate the minds and nurture the souls of readers\,” the exclusive three-day event brings together more than 20 celebrated authors\, speakers\, and moderators—including Dave Barry\, Doris Kearns Goodwin\, Andrew Ross Sorkin\, Maria Semple\, Admiral James Stavridis and more.
