SUMMARY:Healdsburg Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:Featuring a wide variety of fruits and vegetables\, as well as flowers\, cheeses\, honey\, olive oil\, bread\, wild fish\, pasture-finished meat\, and fresh eggs\, the market celebrates the agricultural heritage of this beautiful area. We also have delicious cooked food\, packaged food product and beautiful handmade craft. \nThe market has several special events\, for fun\, and to raise awareness of seasonal produce. Don’t miss the hilarious Zucchini races\, and the great Pumpkin Festival carving contests. Cooking demos\, live music and more will happen as the season progresses. We hope if you live in Healdsburg you will come visit us often\, and if you are in town for vacation or business\, make us part of your travel plans. \nCome have a delicious and nutritious experience at our wonderful Farmers’ Markets! \nNow located at the new Foley Family Community Pavilion. Located at 3 North St (across the street from our previous Saturday market location)\, there’s ample parking across the street\, and on North St itself.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/healdsburg-farmers-market-12/
LOCATION:Foley Family Community Pavilion\, 3 North St.\, Healdsburg
CATEGORIES:Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Healdsburg-Farmers-market-S-P5eEbR.jpg
END:VEVENT
