SUMMARY:Food For Thought’s Plant Sale & Garden Tour
DESCRIPTION:Guided tours of the garden and food bank available by request. \nSupport a great cause while celebrating the joy of gardening! This annual plant sale fundraiser is hosted by Food For Thought food bank\, helping provide healthy food and compassionate support to those in need. Explore the thriving Food For Thought garden\, get inspired by what’s growing for the food bank\, and shop a variety of veggie\, herb\, and flower starts to bring home—lovingly grown by Food For Thought volunteers and community partners. Every purchase helps feed our neighbors in need. \nSince 1988\, Food for Thought has provided life-sustaining groceries\, meals\, and loving support to people living with serious medical conditions in Sonoma County—all free of charge. \nFor more information\, visit fftfoodbank.org/plant-sale
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/food-for-thoughts-plant-sale-garden-tour-2/
