SUMMARY:Knock-Your-Socks-Oﬀ Wildflower Walk
DESCRIPTION:The Goodspeed trail hosts a treasure trove of wildflowers. Here’s a chance to join Certified CA Naturalist John Lynch for a leisurely exploration of this exceptionally lovely trail. You will not be sorry! \nGoodspeed trail starts along the cool banks of the Sonoma Creek as it rushes through a stand of redwoods but quickly heads up hill into the sunlight and a profusion of wildflowers\, butterflies (and a few reptiles). This hike will only take us a couple miles with the turn around just past Pierson Rd – but oh what a couple of miles! \nMeet at the Goodspeed parking lot. Tickets are $10 for general audiences\, $5 for students or youth (12-17 year olds)\, Sugarloaf members\, Sugarloaf or RFO volunteers\, and free for children under 12. Tickets day-of on site are $15 and might not be available. Wear comfortable shoes\, sun protection\, bring at least a quart of water\, a camera or wildflower guides if you have them\, and if desired\, a snack. Parking fees apply.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/knock-your-socks-o%ef%ac%80-wildflower-walk/
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park\, 2605 Adobe Canyon Rd\, Kenwood\, CA
CATEGORIES:Recreation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Wildflowers-Sugarloaf-Park-s.jpg
GEO:38.4427;-122.533
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Sugarloaf Ridge State Park 2605 Adobe Canyon Rd Kenwood CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2605 Adobe Canyon Rd:geo:-122.533,38.4427
END:VEVENT
