SUMMARY:Sonoma County Farm Trails Spring Tour
DESCRIPTION:Join Sonoma County Farm Trails for our Blossoms\, Bees & Barnyard Babies Spring Farm Tour on May 2 & 3\, 2026. This is a self-guided tour of Farm Trails member farms\, ranches\, and producers. Choose your own agrarian adventure with farm tours\, farm animals\, special tastings and workshops\, farm stands\, and more. All are welcome. Registration is FREE but required. Individual tour stops may require additional reservation or charge a fee. Full details will be provided via email.
