SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Reptile Expo
DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa Reptile Expo 2026 on May 2-3\, 2026 is slithering into the Sonoma County Event Center at the Fairgrounds for an unforgettable weekend of exotic animals\, fun\, and family-friendly adventure. Whether you’re a hardcore reptile enthusiast or just looking for something wild to do with the family — this is THE show you don’t want to miss. \nWHAT YOU’LL FIND\n✔ Snakes\, lizards\, geckos\, frogs\, turtles\, tortoises\, tarantulas & more\n✔ Reputable reptile breeders & trusted vendors\n✔ Feeders\, enclosures\, tanks & supplies\n✔ Bioactive & specialty reptile products \n🐊 ALL-DAY FUN\n✨ Exotic reptile encounters\n📸 Live animal shows & photo ops\nMeet incredible animals like a Patagonian Mara\, North American Opossum & even an alligator! \n🎟 EVENT HOURS\nSaturday: 10AM–5PM\nSunday: 10AM–4PM \nSonoma County Event Center at the Fairgrounds\n1350 Bennett Valley Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95404 \n🎫 Family packs & 2-day passes are also available. \n👉 Tickets & Info: https://www.CVRExpo.com \nBring the family\, meet amazing creatures\, and experience Santa Rosa’s must-attend event. See you there!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/santa-rosa-reptile-expo-2/
LOCATION:Sonoma County Event Center at the Fairgrounds\, 1350 Bennett Valley Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/SantaRosaReptileExpoSocialMediaPhotos2026MAINREV.jpg
GEO:38.4316;-122.704
