SUMMARY:Authors on the Plaza
DESCRIPTION:Authors on the Plaza is a free\, open-to-the-public community event presented by the Sonoma Valley Authors Festival\, taking place Saturday\, May 2\, 2026\, from 11 a.m. to 2 p.m. Held beneath the trees of the historic Sonoma Plaza\, the 2026 program features acclaimed authors Dave Barry\, Maria Semple\, Rick Atkinson\, and Colum McCann. \nThis family-friendly outdoor gathering invites the Sonoma community to enjoy an engaging afternoon of conversation and storytelling\, offering moments of humor\, insight\, and inspiration in a relaxed\, open-air setting. While tickets are not required\, attendees are encouraged to register in advance. An on-site bookseller will be available.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/authors-on-the-plaza/
LOCATION:Sonoma Plaza\, 453 1st St E\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
