SUMMARY:Farm Trails Spring Tour + Pizza Pop-Up at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a delicious pizza pop-up featuring wood-fired pizzas crafted by Chef Seamus McCarthy and team. Take a tour of our orchards on foot or by trolley\, soak in the season’s beauty\, and enjoy tasty bites in our Tuscan-inspired Farm Shop and tasting room. \nOn the Menu (available from 12:00-2:30pm or until sold out). Pre-orders recommended. \nPizzas:\nClassic Margherita: Double 8 Dairy Fresh Mozzarella\, Bianco DiNapoli Tomatoes\, Parmigiano Reggiano\, Basil and Gold Ridge Organic Farms Tuscan Blend Extra Virgin Olive Oil $22\nSonoma Mushroom and Pesto: Basil Pesto\, Double 8 Dairy Fresh Mozzarella\, Marinated KM Mushrooms Melange\, Arugula\, Gold Ridge Apple Balsamic Vinegar\, Parmigiano Reggiano and Gold Ridge Organic Farms Picholine Blend Extra Virgin Olive Oil (CONTAINS NUTS) $28\nSpring Vegetable: Bianco DiNapoli Tomato\, Double 8 Dairy Fresh Mozzarella\, Goat Cheese\, Early Summer Squash\, Spring Peas\, Mint\, Basil\, Gold Ridge Organic Farms Minerva Blend Extra Virgin Olive Oil $26 \nSalad:\nSpring Salad: Mixed Greens and Pickled Sonoma Spring Veggies\, Pepita Crumble and Gold Ridge Organic Farms Vinaigrette $12 \nAlso available: Refreshing beverages\, Straus ice cream drizzled with Apple Cider Syrup. \nOrchard Tours:\nJoin Farmer Brooke Hazen on a guided tour of our olive and apple orchards at 1PM or take a ride through our farm on our apple-themed decorative trolley at 11:30AM\, 12PM\, 12:30PM\, 1:30P \nFree kids’ activities all day long \nLive music from the Lisa Liu Trio and friends. \nMeet other local makers\, including Lani Chan from small-batch sauce brand Hei Ma\, and Mai Nguyen – award-winning heirloom grain farmer\, miller\, seed keeper\, and community organizer based right here in Sebastopol. \nDon’t miss this chance to celebrate spring\, taste local flavors\, and explore our orchards during the Sonoma County Farm Trails Spring Tour. \nFREE ENTRY – Reservations only required for pre-order pizzas\, salads and tour tickets. \nDate and Time: On Sat\, 02 May 2026 11:00 – Sat\, 02 May 2026 15:00 \nVenue details: Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Road\, Sebastopol\, California\, 95472\, United States \nCategory: Sports / Leisure | Walking / Guided Tours \nPrice:\nFree: USD 0.00
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/farm-trails-spring-tour-pizza-pop-up-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Road\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Kids and Family,Music,Other
GEO:38.34636;-122.80582
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Gold Ridge Organic Farms 3387 Canfield Road Sebastopol 95472;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=3387 Canfield Road:geo:-122.80582,38.34636
END:VEVENT
